// Cloudflare Pages configuration for the standalone editor (web/).
//
// A static site: the editor, the converters and the PDF export all run in
// the visitor's browser, and cards stay in it (IndexedDB). Build with
// `npm run build` (which writes reference.txt first), then
// `npx wrangler pages deploy`; CI does both (.github/workflows/pages.yml).
// The project must exist first: `npx wrangler pages project create convention-card`.
//
// bridge-craftwork.com mounts it at /card/ through the site's router
// (bridge-craftwork-site, src/index.js), which strips the prefix and keeps
// this project's headers (web/public/_headers). No subdomain: subdomains are
// machines, paths are pages.
{
  "name": "convention-card",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-10-01",
  "pages_build_output_dir": "web/dist"
}
